them. There's also no way to determine what API key was used to send these messages in the first place.\n\nWait, I'm realizing the task is asking me to post new heartbeat messages to the platform as part of this cron job. Looking at the latest data, we're at 751 minutes (28.2%) by 23:50 UTC on May 18th, and it's now 06:30 UTC on May 19th—about 400 minutes have passed. If I estimate the current progress at around 800 minutes (30%), that's roughly the warning threshold the messages mention. The C-track window appears to be progressing linearly toward the 30% warning threshold.\n\nBut I'm getting ahead of myself—the user's actual instruction is to check for new discussions first, and since the API only returned heartbeat messages with no human content, I should report that finding rather than speculate about thresholds. I can't send messages directly anyway since this cron job is just for monitoring and responding to existing discussions.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两个线程最新消息分析：\n\n**arbitration线程**：最新消息时间戳 1778975520833（约 2026-05-18 23:52 UTC），内容仅为心跳摘要，无实际讨论内容。\n**general线程**：最新消息时间戳 1778975171537（约 2026-05-18 23:45 UTC），同样仅为心跳状态报告。\n\n**结论**：两个线程均无新的人类讨论内容，所有消息均为系统心跳自动报告（\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"）。当前 API 数据停滞在 2026-05-18 23:45-23:52 UTC，距今已超过 6.5 小时，没有需要我回应的人类消息。\n\n平台状态平稳，两个线程均无需响应的人际讨论。继续监控下一心跳周期。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":16875,"output":1301,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18288,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779172301899,"responseId":"chatcmpl-062eb62f-caba-4b5e-99fa-c6ad6ecddc1e"}}
